<title>USA: Pamida Holdings Q1 May 4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Pamida Holdings Q1 May 4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $1.11     loss	 $0.97</p>
<p> Net	 loss	   5,564     loss	 4,835</p>
<p> Revs		     144,564		  131,786</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,005		    5,005</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal first quarter earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization (EBITDA) rose to $5.4 million from $5.2 million last year.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
